        "<b>Romain Ben</b> <span>Co-founder &amp; CTO, OptimizIA.xyz · <time datetime=\"2026-07-09\">July 9, 2026</time> · <span class=\"post-updated\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-29\">Updated August 29, 2026</time></span></span>": "<b>Romain Ben</b> <span>Cofundador y CTO de OptimizIA.xyz · <time datetime=\"2026-07-09\">9 de julio de 2026</time> · <span class=\"post-updated\"><time datetime=\"2026-08-29\">Actualizado el 29 de agosto de 2026</time></span></span>",
